## Derivative work notice

This repository is a derivative work of **WebSpeak**, based on:

- Upstream: `EchoSixHIYA/WebSpeak-client-for-TeamSpeak`
  <https://github.com/EchoSixHIYA/WebSpeak-client-for-TeamSpeak>
- Upstream baseline: `v0.2.4` (commit `ca84029` in this history, tagged `upstream-v0.2.4`)

**Statement of changes (AGPL-3.0 §5)**: the source has been modified since upstream `v0.2.4`.
The changes and their dates are recorded in [`CHANGELOG.md`](./CHANGELOG.md) under version `0.2.5`
and later, with the corresponding commit history in this repository's Git log. The main areas are the
migration of the WebRTC media engine to a single mediasoup engine, retirement of the WebSocket binary
audio channel, screen sharing moved to SFU central forwarding through the gateway (with H.264 hardware
encoding), and a number of bug fixes.

